    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Udg\u00e5ende kanaler", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Begivenheder forbliver inde i appen;hvis du vil, send den samme advarsel til din telefons meddelelsescenter eller til Telegram.Ingen af \u200b\u200bdisse er p\u00e5kr\u00e6vet.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Indtast et emnenavn - ingen konto n\u00f8dvendig", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Emne", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Meddelelser udgives til dette emne p\u00e5 ntfy.sh;hvis kun du kender emnenavnet, er det kun dig, der modtager dem.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "E-mail", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Advarsler sendes til din kontos e-mailadresse", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Sendt til din egen adresse, mens du er logget ind;ingen hemmeligheder gemmes i appen.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Modtager", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Notifikationer p\u00e5 tv\u00e6rs af enheder", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Et familiemedlems advarsel ankommer i notifikationscentret, selv n\u00e5r appen er lukket", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "G\u00e5r til andre medlemmers og dine andre enheders notifikationscentre;modtageren skal have denne kanal aktiveret p\u00e5 sin enhed.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST til din egen server \u2014 avanceret", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Kun HTTPS accepteres;hver begivenhed sendes som {kilde, id, titel, detaljer, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Bot token", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "Chat-id", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Bot-tokenet forbliver kun p\u00e5 denne enhed", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Tokenet uploades aldrig til skyen;genindtast det p\u00e5 andre enheder.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
    "Sistem Bildirimleri": "Systemmeddelelser", // EN: System Notifications
    "Taray\u0131c\u0131 ve telefonun uyar\u0131 merkezi": "Din browser og telefonmeddelelsescenter", // EN: Your browser and phone notification centre
    "\u0130zin bekleniyor\u2026": "Venter p\u00e5 tilladelse...", // EN: Waiting for permission…
    "\u0130zin verildi": "Tilladelse givet", // EN: Permission granted
    "\u0130zin zaten a\u00e7\u0131k": "Tilladelsen er allerede p\u00e5", // EN: Permission already on
    "\u0130zin reddedilmi\u015f": "Tilladelse n\u00e6gtet", // EN: Permission denied
    "Bildirim deste\u011fi yok": "Ingen underretningsst\u00f8tte", // EN: No notification support
    "De\u011fi\u015fiklikler otomatik kaydedilir.": "\u00c6ndringer gemmes automatisk.", // EN: Changes are saved automatically.
    "Bildirim motoru bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde y\u00fcklenmedi.": "Meddelelsesmotoren blev ikke indl\u00e6st i denne build.", // EN: The notification engine didn't load in this build.
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal": "\u00c5bn kanal", // EN: Open channel
    "Hi\u00e7bir kanal a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil.": "Ingen kanal er aktiveret.", // EN: No channel is enabled.
    "G\u00f6nderilen {0}": "{0} sendt", // EN: {0} sent
    "Hatal\u0131 {0}": "{0} mislykkedes", // EN: {0} failed
    "Son hata": "Sidste fejl", // EN: Last error
    "\u015eu an rahats\u0131z etmeyin a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Forstyr ikke er t\u00e6ndt lige nu.", // EN: Do Not Disturb is on right now.
    "\u015eu an sessiz saatler i\u00e7inde.": "Stille timer er aktive lige nu.", // EN: Quiet hours are active right now.
    "\u00dcstteki anahtar kapal\u0131": "Kontakten ovenfor er slukket", // EN: The switch above is off
    "hi\u00e7bir bildirim g\u00f6nderilmez.": "der sendes ingen besked.", // EN: no notification is sent.
    "G\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "Sender...", // EN: Sending…
    "\u0130letildi": "Leveret", // EN: Delivered
    "Baz\u0131 kanallar hata verdi": "Nogle kanaler fejlede", // EN: Some channels failed
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal yok": "Ingen kanal aktiveret", // EN: No channel enabled
    "Sessiz saatlerde d\u0131\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fck kanallar durur; uyar\u0131lar uygulama i\u00e7inde birikmeye devam eder.": "I stille timer pauser udg\u00e5ende kanaler;advarsler bliver ved med at akkumulere inde i appen.", // EN: During quiet hours outbound channels pause; alerts keep accumulating inside the app.
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar sessiz saatleri a\u015fs\u0131n": "Lad kritiske alarmer omg\u00e5 stille timer", // EN: Let critical alerts bypass quiet hours
    "G\u00fcvenlik, acil durum ve alarm olaylar\u0131 bu saatlerde de bildirilir.": "Sikkerheds-, n\u00f8d- og alarmbegivenheder leveres stadig i disse timer.", // EN: Security, emergency and alarm events are still delivered during those hours.
    "Ses ve Titre\u015fim": "Lyd og vibration", // EN: Sound and Vibration
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar her zaman sesli gelir. Titre\u015fim yaln\u0131zca telefonda ge\u00e7erlidir; Android'de ses ve titre\u015fim ayr\u0131ca telefonun bildirim ayarlar\u0131ndan da de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.": "Kritiske alarmer lyder altid.Vibration g\u00e6lder kun p\u00e5 telefoner;p\u00e5 Android kan lyd og vibration ogs\u00e5 \u00e6ndres i systemmeddelelsesindstillingerne.", // EN: Critical alerts always sound. Vibration applies on phones only; on Android, sound and vibration can also be changed in the system notification settings.
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131nca ba\u015flat": "Start med computer", // EN: Start with computer
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS arka planda a\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n.": "Start NEXUS i baggrunden, n\u00e5r din computer starter.", // EN: Launch NEXUS in the background when your computer starts.
    "Kapat\u0131nca arka planda \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r": "Bliv ved med at k\u00f8re i baggrunden, n\u00e5r den er lukket", // EN: Keep running in background when closed
    "Pencere kapat\u0131lsa da otomasyonlar tepside \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam etsin.": "Automatiseringer bliver ved med at k\u00f8re i systembakken, n\u00e5r vinduet er lukket.", // EN: Automations keep running in system tray when the window is closed.
