    "Hareket, kap\u0131/pencere ve \u00e7evre sens\u00f6rleri": "Bev\u00e6gelses-, d\u00f8r-/vindue- og milj\u00f8sensorer", // EN: Motion, door/window and environmental sensors
    "\u0130klimlendirme ve Enerji": "Klima og energi", // EN: Climate and Energy
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 priz, r\u00f6le ve anahtar \u00fcr\u00fcnleri": "Smart stik, rel\u00e6 og switch produkter", // EN: Smart plug, relay and switch products
