    "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ge\u00e7mi\u015f yok; yaln\u0131zca son okumalar d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ingen gemt historie endnu;kun de seneste afl\u00e6sninger eksporteres.", // EN: No stored history yet; only the latest readings are exported.
    "G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en cihaz ekleyince ger\u00e7ek de\u011fer burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Tilf\u00f8j en str\u00f8mm\u00e5lingsenhed for at se reelle v\u00e6rdier her.", // EN: Add a power-metering device to see real values here.
    "{0} g\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcml\u00fc cihazdan ger\u00e7ek okuma.": "Live afl\u00e6sning fra {0} m\u00e5lte enhed(er).", // EN: Live reading from {0} metered device(s).
    "Cihazlardan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131namad\u0131 (\u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olabilir).": "Kunne ikke l\u00e6se m\u00e5linger (enheder kan v\u00e6re offline).", // EN: Could not read measurements (devices may be offline).
    "\u00b7 Etkin (her gece 23:00)": "\u00b7 Aktiv (aften kl. 23:00)", // EN: · Active (nightly at 23:00)
    "\u00b7 Etkin (konum tetiklemesi yak\u0131nda)": "\u00b7 Aktiv (placeringsudl\u00f8ser kommer snart)", // EN: · Active (location trigger coming soon)
    "Bu strateji zamanlamayla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken (masa\u00fcst\u00fcnde tepsideyken) her gece 23:00'te se\u00e7ili enerji cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc keser.": "Denne strategi k\u00f8rer efter en tidsplan: Mens appen er \u00e5ben (i bakken p\u00e5 skrivebordet), afbryder den str\u00f8mmen til de valgte energienheder hver nat kl. 23:00.", // EN: This strategy runs on a schedule: while the app is open (in the tray on desktop), it cuts power to the selected energy devices nightly at 23:00.
    "Bu strateji konum tetiklemesine dayan\u0131r; otomatik konum tetiklemesi hen\u00fcz yok. Etkinle\u015ftirdi\u011finde kaydedilir ama kendili\u011finden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Denne strategi er afh\u00e6ngig af lokationsudl\u00f8sere;automatisk lokationsudl\u00f8sning er ikke tilg\u00e6ngelig endnu.Aktivering gemmer den, men den k\u00f8rer ikke af sig selv.", // EN: This strategy relies on location triggers; automatic location triggering isn't available yet. Enabling saves it, but it won't run on its own.
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz otomatik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor; kaydetti\u011finde a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da se\u00e7ti\u011fin saatte (zamanlamayla) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Denne triggertype k\u00f8rer endnu ikke automatisk;n\u00e5r den er gemt, k\u00f8rer den p\u00e5 det tidspunkt, du v\u00e6lger nedenfor (planlagt).", // EN: This trigger type doesn't run automatically yet; once saved, it runs at the time you pick below (scheduled).
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu tetikleyicisi kurulamaz: uygulamada okunabilen ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneli durumu veya NEXUS d\u00fczeyinde bir mod anahtar\u0131 hen\u00fcz yok. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "En sikkerhedstilstandsudl\u00f8ser kan ikke konfigureres: Appen har endnu ingen l\u00e6sbar alarmpaneltilstand eller NEXUS-niveautilstandskontakt.Arbejdstyper: Timer, Vejr, Enhedstilstand og Alarm udl\u00f8st (sensor).", // EN: A security-mode trigger can't be set up: the app has no readable alarm-panel state or NEXUS-level mode switch yet. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Denne triggertype er ikke underst\u00f8ttet endnu, s\u00e5 den kan ikke gemmes.Arbejdstyper: Timer, Vejr, Enhedstilstand og Alarm udl\u00f8st (sensor).", // EN: This trigger type isn't supported yet, so it can't be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Hava Ko\u015fulu": "Vejrforhold", // EN: Weather Condition
    "Ev konumunun ger\u00e7ek hava verisi uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dk'da bir okunur. Ko\u015ful sa\u011flanm\u0131yorken sa\u011flan\u0131r hale geldi\u011finde senaryo bir kez \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Reelle vejrdata for din hjemmeposition afl\u00e6ses hvert 10. minut, mens appen er \u00e5ben.Scenariet k\u00f8rer \u00e9n gang, n\u00e5r betingelsen g\u00e5r fra ikke opfyldt til opfyldt.", // EN: Real weather data for your home location is read about every 10 minutes while the app is open. The scenario runs once when the condition goes from not met to met.
