    "Hava durumu tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Vejrudl\u00f8ser: ingen hjemmeplacering angivet.", // EN: Weather trigger: no home location set.
    "Tetiklenince \u00c7al\u0131\u015facak Senaryo": "Scenario til at k\u00f8re, n\u00e5r det udl\u00f8ses", // EN: Scenario to Run When Triggered
    "Yaln\u0131zca bildirim": "Kun underretning", // EN: Notification only
    "Zamanlamal\u0131 otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Planlagte automatiseringer k\u00f8rer, mens appen er \u00e5ben;p\u00e5 desktop k\u00f8rer de, mens appen bliver i bakken.", // EN: Scheduled automations run while the app is open; on desktop they keep running while the app stays in the tray.
    "Otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Automatiseringer k\u00f8rer, mens appen er \u00e5ben;p\u00e5 skrivebordet forts\u00e6tter tidsplanerne, mens appen forbliver i bakken.", // EN: Automations run while the app is open; on desktop, schedules continue while the app stays in the tray.
