    "G\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131 tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Solnedgangsudl\u00f8ser: ingen hjemmeplacering angivet.", // EN: Sunset trigger: no home location set.
    "Tetikleme saati ka\u00e7\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 (uygulama kapal\u0131yd\u0131).": "Udl\u00f8sertid forpasset (appen blev lukket).", // EN: Trigger time missed (the app was closed).
    "Kameralar": "Kameraer", // EN: Cameras
    "Kamera Cihazlar\u0131m": "Mine kameraer", // EN: My Cameras
    "Kamera ekleyince durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 buradan izlersin. Video ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 (RTSP) deste\u011fi yak\u0131nda.": "Tilf\u00f8j et kamera for at overv\u00e5ge dets status og privatlivsindstilling her.Underst\u00f8ttelse af videostreaming (RTSP) kommer snart.", // EN: Add a camera to monitor its status and privacy setting here. Video streaming (RTSP) support is coming soon.
    "Kamera Ekle": "Tilf\u00f8j kamera", // EN: Add Camera
    "Bu ekranda kamera cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n ger\u00e7ek durumu listelenir. Canl\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fc ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 i\u00e7in cihaz\u0131n\u0131n kendi uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "Denne sk\u00e6rm viser den reelle status for dine kameraenheder.Til live video skal du bruge dit kameras egen app.", // EN: This screen lists the real status of your camera devices. For live video, use your camera's own app.
    "G\u0130ZL\u0130L\u0130K MODU": "PRIVAT TILSTAND", // EN: PRIVACY MODE
    "Yerle\u015fik k\u00f6pr\u00fc yok": "Ingen indbygget bro", // EN: No built-in bridge
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol Home Assistant k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcd\u00fcr: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS styrer dine enheder direkte fra sin egen app;den inkluderer ikke en HomeKit-bro.For at bruge dem med Apple Home (HomeKit) er den praktiske vej Home Assistant-broen: f\u00f8j dine enheder til Home Assistant, og aktiver derefter HA's HomeKit-integration.", // EN: NEXUS controls your devices directly from its own app; it does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is the Home Assistant bridge: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "Home Assistant K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc A\u00e7": "\u00c5bn Home Assistant Bridge", // EN: Open Home Assistant Bridge
    "HomeKit ile Kullanma": "Brug med HomeKit", // EN: Using with HomeKit
    "Masa\u00fcst\u00fc HomeKit K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc": "Desktop HomeKit Bridge", // EN: Desktop HomeKit Bridge
    "masa\u00fcst\u00fc s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde": "p\u00e5 skrivebordet,", // EN: on desktop,
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir;": "NEXUS styrer dine enheder direkte fra sin egen app;", // EN: NEXUS controls your devices directly from its own app;
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Durdur": "Stop Bridge", // EN: Stop Bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor": "Broen k\u00f8rer", // EN: Bridge running
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor": "Broen er ikke tilg\u00e6ngelig", // EN: Bridge unavailable
    "HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc bu kurulumda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor (kit/bridge.cjs y\u00fcklenemedi) \u2014 Apple Ev i\u00e7in Home Assistant k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc \u00f6neririz.": "HomeKit-broen er ikke tilg\u00e6ngelig i denne installation (kit/bridge.cjs kunne ikke indl\u00e6ses) \u2014 til Apple Home anbefaler vi Home Assistant-broen.", // EN: The HomeKit bridge isn't available in this install (kit/bridge.cjs could not be loaded) — for Apple Home we recommend the Home Assistant bridge.
    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor \u00b7 port {0} \u00b7 {1} cihaz": "K\u00f8rer \u00b7 port {0} \u00b7 {1} enheder", // EN: Running · port {0} · {1} devices
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. E\u015fle\u015fme kal\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131p tepside bekledik\u00e7e ev uygulamas\u0131ndaki anahtarlar ger\u00e7ek cihaza gider.": "Broen skal v\u00e6re p\u00e5 samme Wi-Fi som din iOS-enhed.Parring forts\u00e6tter;s\u00e5 l\u00e6nge NEXUS forbliver k\u00f8rende i bakken, g\u00e5r kontakter i Home-appen til den rigtige enhed.", // EN: The bridge must be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. Pairing persists; as long as NEXUS stays running in the tray, switches in the Home app go to the real device.
    "Hesab\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131 kay\u0131tlar": "Linket til din konto", // EN: Linked to your account
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcler ve a\u00e7\u0131k kaynak": "Broer og open source", // EN: Bridges and open source
    "Bu yaz\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131ran cihazlar a\u011fda otomatik bulunur.": "Enheder, der k\u00f8rer denne software, findes automatisk p\u00e5 netv\u00e6rket.", // EN: Devices running this software are found automatically on the network.
    "HomeKit ve Apple Ev, Apple Inc. tescilli markalar\u0131d\u0131r. Bu ad\u0131mlar telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc i\u00e7indir: cihaz kontrol\u00fc Home Assistant \u00fczerinden iletilir. Masa\u00fcst\u00fc s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde NEXUS kendi yerle\u015fik k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc yay\u0131nlar (yukar\u0131daki panel).": "HomeKit og Apple Home er varem\u00e6rker tilh\u00f8rende Apple Inc. Disse trin er for telefon-/webversionen: enhedskontrol videresendes via Home Assistant.P\u00e5 desktop udgiver NEXUS sin egen indbyggede bro (panelet ovenfor).", // EN: HomeKit and Apple Home are trademarks of Apple Inc. These steps are for the phone/web version: device control is relayed via Home Assistant. On desktop, NEXUS publishes its own built-in bridge (the panel above).
    "Payla\u015f\u0131lacak cihaz yok: yerel a\u011fda anahtar yetene\u011fi olan cihaz laz\u0131m": "Ingen enheder at dele: Der kr\u00e6ves en enhed med switch-funktion p\u00e5 dit lokale netv\u00e6rk", // EN: No devices to share: a device with the switch capability on your local network is required
    "ge\u00e7ersiz komut": "ugyldig kommando", // EN: invalid command
    "cihaz bulunamad\u0131": "enhed ikke fundet", // EN: device not found
    "komut zaman a\u015f\u0131m\u0131": "kommandoen fik timeout", // EN: command timed out
