    "k\u00f6pr\u00fc ba\u015flamad\u0131": "broen startede ikke", // EN: bridge didn't start
    "NEXUS'ta Entegrasyonlar \u00fczerinden Home Assistant'\u0131 ba\u011fla.": "Tilslut Home Assistant fra integrationer i NEXUS.", // EN: Connect Home Assistant from Integrations in NEXUS.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'ta NEXUS hesab\u0131nla e\u015fle\u015ftir.": "Par dine enheder i Home Assistant med din NEXUS-konto.", // EN: Pair your devices in Home Assistant with your NEXUS account.
    "Home Assistant ayarlar\u0131ndan HomeKit Bridge entegrasyonunu ekle; payla\u015fmak istedi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131 se\u00e7.": "I Home Assistant-indstillingerne skal du tilf\u00f8je HomeKit Bridge-integrationen og v\u00e6lge de enheder, der skal deles.", // EN: In Home Assistant settings, add the HomeKit Bridge integration and pick the devices to share.
    "Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131nda \"Aksesuar Ekle\" ile HA'n\u0131n verdi\u011fi kodu gir.": "I Apple Home-appen skal du bruge \"Tilf\u00f8j tilbeh\u00f8r\" og indtaste koden Home Assistant giver.", // EN: In the Apple Home app, use "Add Accessory" and enter the code Home Assistant provides.
    "HomeKit ve Apple Ev, Apple Inc. tescilli markalar\u0131d\u0131r. Cihaz kontrol\u00fc Home Assistant \u00fczerinden iletilir; NEXUS do\u011frudan HomeKit aksesuar\u0131 yay\u0131nlamaz.": "HomeKit og Apple Home er varem\u00e6rker tilh\u00f8rende Apple Inc. Enhedskontrol videregives via Home Assistant;NEXUS eksponerer ikke HomeKit-tilbeh\u00f8r direkte.", // EN: HomeKit and Apple Home are trademarks of Apple Inc. Device control is relayed via Home Assistant; NEXUS does not expose HomeKit accessories directly.
    "Sorun mu ya\u015f\u0131yorsun? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Har du problemer?Send feedback", // EN: Having trouble? Send feedback
    "CarPlay Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "CarPlay Support kommer snart", // EN: CarPlay Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz CarPlay uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eve yakla\u015f\u0131rken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p klimay\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabileceksin.": "NEXUS inkluderer endnu ikke en CarPlay-app.N\u00e5r den afsendes, vil du v\u00e6re i stand til at t\u00e6nde lys og k\u00f8re AC, n\u00e5r du n\u00e6rmer dig hjem.", // EN: NEXUS doesn't include a CarPlay app yet. When it ships, you'll be able to turn on lights and run the AC as you approach home.
    "Bug\u00fcn Arabada": "I din bil i dag", // EN: In Your Car Today
    "NEXUS'u telefonunda ana ekrana ekle (PWA); ara\u00e7ta kontrol i\u00e7in senaryo ve otomasyonlar arka planda \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Tilf\u00f8j NEXUS til din telefons startsk\u00e6rm (PWA);til kontrol i bilen k\u00f8rer scenarier og automatiseringer i baggrunden.", // EN: Add NEXUS to your phone's home screen (PWA); for in-car control, scenarios and automations run in the background.
    "\"Eve Geldim\" senaryosunu tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r: \u0131\u015f\u0131klar, klima ve perdeler haz\u0131r.": "K\u00f8r \"Velkommen hjem\"-scenariet med et enkelt tryk: lys, AC og covers klar.", // EN: Run the "Welcome Home" scenario with one tap: lights, AC and covers ready.
    "Zamanlanm\u0131\u015f otomasyonlar (\u00f6r. gece enerji kesme) sen ara\u00e7ta de\u011filken de \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Planlagte automatiseringer (f.eks. str\u00f8mafbrydelse om natten) k\u00f8rer, selv n\u00e5r du er v\u00e6k.", // EN: Scheduled automations (e.g. night power cut) run even while you're away.
    "Senaryolar\u0131 ve Otomasyonlar\u0131 A\u00e7": "\u00c5bn Scenarier og automatiseringer", // EN: Open Scenarios & Automations
