    "Fabrika s\u0131f\u0131rlama": "Fabriksindstilling", // EN: Factory reset
    "Shelly: cihaz \u00fczerindeki d\u00fc\u011fmeyi ~10 sn bas\u0131l\u0131 tut (LED h\u0131zl\u0131 yan\u0131p s\u00f6ner).": "Shelly: hold knappen p\u00e5 enheden nede i ~10 s (LED blinker hurtigt).", // EN: Shelly: hold the button on the device for ~10 s (LED blinks fast).
    "Tasmota: ayarlar \u2192 Reset \u2192 Reset device. Veya d\u00fc\u011fmeyi 40 sn bas\u0131l\u0131 tut.": "Tasmota: Indstillinger \u2192 Nulstil \u2192 Nulstil enhed, eller hold knappen nede i 40 s.", // EN: Tasmota: Settings → Reset → Reset device, or hold the button for 40 s.
    "WLED: ayarlar \u2192 Security & Updates \u2192 Factory reset.": "WLED: Indstillinger \u2192 Sikkerhed og opdateringer \u2192 Fabriksindstilling.", // EN: WLED: Settings → Security & Updates → Factory reset.
    "ESPHome: cihaz donan\u0131m\u0131na g\u00f6re d\u00fc\u011fmeyle veya config'ten 'factory_reset' eylemi.": "ESPHome: via enhedsknappen eller 'factory_reset'-handlingen i dens konfiguration.", // EN: ESPHome: via the device button or the 'factory_reset' action in its config.
    "Hue: ampul\u00fc kapat-a\u00e7 s\u0131ras\u0131yla (4 kez) fabrika moduna al\u0131r; k\u00f6pr\u00fc s\u0131f\u0131rlamalar\u0131 Hue uygulamas\u0131ndan.": "Hue: t\u00e6nd og sluk p\u00e6ren 4 gange for fabrikstilstand;nulstilling af bro udf\u00f8res i Hue-appen.", // EN: Hue: power-cycle the bulb 4 times for factory mode; bridge resets are done in the Hue app.
    "Kasa: cihaz\u0131 5 sn prize tak-\u00e7\u0131kar; tekrar e\u015fle\u015ftirme gerekir.": "Kasa: Tag stikket ud/tilslut enheden i 5 s;du bliver n\u00f8dt til at parre den igen.", // EN: Kasa: unplug/replug the device for 5 s; you'll need to pair it again.
    "Yeelight: duvar d\u00fc\u011fmesini 5 kez a\u00e7-kapa (reset modu).": "Yeelight: Sluk v\u00e6gkontakten 5 gange (nulstil-tilstand).", // EN: Yeelight: flip the wall switch off-on 5 times (reset mode).
    "WiZ: duvar d\u00fc\u011fmesini h\u0131zl\u0131ca 5 kez a\u00e7-kapa.": "WiZ: Sluk hurtigt for v\u00e6gkontakten 5 gange.", // EN: WiZ: flip the wall switch off-on quickly 5 times.
    "LIFX: d\u00fc\u011fmeyi bas\u0131l\u0131 tutun (LED beyaz d\u00f6ner) sonra b\u0131rak\u0131n.": "LIFX: hold knappen nede (LED lyser hvidt), og slip derefter.", // EN: LIFX: hold the button (LED cycles white), then release.
    "Govee LAN: cihaz\u0131n kendi d\u00fc\u011fmesiyle veya Govee uygulamas\u0131ndan.": "Govee LAN: med enhedens egen knap eller fra Govee-appen.", // EN: Govee LAN: with the device's own button or from the Govee app.
    "Sonoff DIY: d\u00fc\u011fmeyi 5+ sn bas\u0131l\u0131 tut.": "Sonoff DIY: hold knappen nede i 5+ sekunder.", // EN: Sonoff DIY: hold the button for 5+ seconds.
    "Tapo: uygulamas\u0131ndan ayarlar \u2192 cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r/s\u0131f\u0131rla; kamera ise SETUP d\u00fc\u011fmesi 5 sn.": "Tapo: fra dens app, Indstillinger \u2192 fjern/nulstil enheden;kameraer bruger SETUP-knappen i 5 sek.", // EN: Tapo: from its app, Settings → remove/reset the device; cameras use the SETUP button for 5 s.
    "Cihaz\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlamak i\u00e7in \u00fcreticinin uygulamas\u0131ndaki Fabrika S\u0131f\u0131rlama ad\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 kullan.": "For at nulstille enheden skal du bruge trinnet til nulstilling af fabriksindstillinger i producentens app.", // EN: To reset the device, use the Factory Reset step in the manufacturer's app.
    "En az 8 karakter; harf + rakam kullan.": "Mindst 8 tegn;brug bogstaver + cifre.", // EN: At least 8 characters; use letters + digits.
    "\u00c7ok zay\u0131f \u2014 en az 8 karakter kullan.": "Meget svag \u2014 brug mindst 8 tegn.", // EN: Very weak — use at least 8 characters.
    "Zay\u0131f \u2014 harf + rakam ekle.": "Svag \u2014 tilf\u00f8j bogstaver + cifre.", // EN: Weak — add letters + digits.
    "Orta \u2014 b\u00fcy\u00fck harf veya simge ekle.": "Fair \u2014 tilf\u00f8j et stort bogstav eller symbol.", // EN: Fair — add an uppercase letter or symbol.
    "\u0130yi.": "God.", // EN: Good.
    "G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc \u015fifre.": "St\u00e6rk adgangskode.", // EN: Strong password.
