    "Bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r": "Tilg\u00e6ngelig med en cloud-konto", // EN: Available with a cloud account
    "\u00d6nce bulut hesab\u0131nla giri\u015f yap.": "Log f\u00f8rst ind med din cloud-konto.", // EN: Sign in with your cloud account first.
    "Durum al\u0131namad\u0131": "Status kunne ikke indl\u00e6ses", // EN: Couldn't load the status
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131 kodu a\u00e7\u0131k": "Autentificeringskoden er sl\u00e5et til", // EN: Authenticator code is on
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r.": "Totrinsbekr\u00e6ftelse kr\u00e6ver en cloud-konto.", // EN: Two-step verification needs a cloud account.
    "Kapatmak i\u00e7in kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki kodu gir.": "Indtast godkendelseskoden for at sl\u00e5 den fra.", // EN: Enter the authenticator code to turn it off.
    "Kodu kimlik uygulamas\u0131na okut, sonra uygulamadaki 6 haneyi gir.": "Scan koden med din autentificeringsapp, og indtast derefter de 6 cifre.", // EN: Scan the code with your authenticator app, then enter the 6 digits.
    "Kurulum kodu": "Ops\u00e6tningskode", // EN: Setup code
    "Kodu okutam\u0131yorsan bu anahtar\u0131 uygulamaya yaz:": "Hvis du ikke kan scanne den, skal du indtaste denne n\u00f8gle i appen:", // EN: If you can't scan it, type this key into the app:
    "Kod 6 hane olmal\u0131.": "Koden skal v\u00e6re p\u00e5 6 cifre.", // EN: The code must be 6 digits.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti.": "Koden er forkert eller er udl\u00f8bet.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti. Telefonunun saati otomatik ayarl\u0131 de\u011filse kodlar tutmaz; saati otomati\u011fe al\u0131p yenilenen kodu bir kez dene.": "Koden er forkert eller er udl\u00f8bet.Koderne stemmer ikke overens, hvis din telefons ur ikke er indstillet automatisk;skift den til automatisk og pr\u00f8v den opdaterede kode \u00e9n gang.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired. Codes do not match if your phone's clock is not set automatically; switch it to automatic and try the refreshed code once.
    "Kod do\u011frulanamad\u0131.": "Koden kunne ikke bekr\u00e6ftes.", // EN: The code could not be verified.
    "\u0130\u015flem tamamlanamad\u0131.": "Handlingen kunne ikke fuldf\u00f8res.", // EN: The action could not be completed.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Totrinsbekr\u00e6ftelse er aktiveret.", // EN: Two-step verification is on.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama kapat\u0131ld\u0131.": "Totrinsbekr\u00e6ftelse er sl\u00e5et fra.", // EN: Two-step verification is off.
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki 6 haneli kodu gir.": "Indtast den 6-cifrede kode fra din autentificeringsapp.", // EN: Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app.
    "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator gibi bir kimlik uygulamas\u0131 a\u00e7.": "\u00c5bn en godkendelsesapp s\u00e5som Google Authenticator eller Microsoft Authenticator.", // EN: Open an authenticator app such as Google Authenticator or Microsoft Authenticator.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kodu okut ya da anahtar\u0131 elle gir.": "Scan koden nedenfor eller indtast n\u00f8glen i h\u00e5nden.", // EN: Scan the code below or enter the key by hand.
    "Uygulamadaki 6 haneli kodu yaz ve Do\u011frula'ya dokun.": "Indtast den 6-cifrede kode fra appen, og tryk p\u00e5 Bekr\u00e6ft.", // EN: Type the 6-digit code from the app and tap Verify.
    "Uygulamada eski bir NEXUS kayd\u0131 varsa sil; her kurulumda yeni anahtar \u00fcretilir, yaln\u0131z en son okuttu\u011funun kodu ge\u00e7erlidir.": "Slet enhver gammel NEXUS-post i appen;hver ops\u00e6tning opretter en ny n\u00f8gle, og kun koden for den, du scannede sidst, er gyldig.", // EN: Delete any old NEXUS entry in the app; each setup creates a new key, and only the code of the one you scanned last is valid.
    "Geli\u015fmi\u015f ba\u011flant\u0131lar: Home Assistant cihaz\u0131 ekle": "Avancerede forbindelser: Tilf\u00f8j Home Assistant-enheder", // EN: Advanced connections: add Home Assistant devices
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, cihaz kimli\u011finin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Kunne ikke oprette forbindelse til enheden.S\u00f8rg for, at den er p\u00e5 det samme netv\u00e6rk, og at enheds-id'et og den lokale n\u00f8gle er korrekte.", // EN: Could not connect to the device. Make sure it is on the same network and that the device ID and local key are correct.
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parolan\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Kunne ikke oprette forbindelse til m\u00e6gleren.S\u00f8rg for, at brugernavnet og adgangskoden er korrekt.", // EN: Could not connect to the broker. Make sure the username and password are correct.
