    "\u00d6deme ge\u00e7mi\u015fi (Sipari\u015flerim)": "Betalingshistorik (Mine ordrer)", // EN: Payment history (My Orders)
    "Faturaland\u0131rmay\u0131 y\u00f6net": "Administrer fakturering", // EN: Manage billing
    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Problemer med en ordre?Send feedback", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Klare varer virker nu;varer, der ikke er klar, er markeret \"Kommer snart\".", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Apple Watch Support kommer snart", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUS inkluderer endnu ikke en Apple Watch-app.N\u00e5r den er frigivet, vil du v\u00e6re i stand til at k\u00f8re scenarier og se kritiske advarsler fra dit h\u00e5ndled.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Hvad du kan g\u00f8re i dag", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Hold meddelelser t\u00e6ndt for kritiske h\u00e6ndelser;du ser advarsler p\u00e5 din telefon med det samme.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Hvorvidt disse meddelelser vises p\u00e5 dit ur, afh\u00e6nger af din iPhones urindstillinger;NEXUS sender ikke noget specifikt til uret.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "\u00c5bn meddelelsesindstillinger", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Kopi\u00e9r n\u00f8gle", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "\u00c5bn i Authenticator-appen", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Hvis du mister adgangen til din autentificeringsapp, vil du ikke kunne logge ind, fordi der kr\u00e6ves en kode ved login.Gem denne n\u00f8gle et sikkert sted.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "N\u00f8gle kopieret \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Kunne ikke kopiere;skriv n\u00f8glen i h\u00e5nden.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
