    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Slet min konto", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Din konto, profil og synkroniserede data slettes permanent.Hvis du har et aktivt NEXUS+-abonnement, skal du f\u00f8rst opsige det fra Billing.Dette kan ikke fortrydes.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Er du sikker?Tryk igen for at slette", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Sletter...", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Konto slettet.Husk at opsige dit abonnement fra din Whop-konto.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Din konto og data blev slettet.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "For at fjerne NEXUS-data p\u00e5 denne enhed er Indstillinger \u2192 Log ud nok;der er ingen cloud-konto.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Sletningen af \u200b\u200bkontoen p\u00e5 serversiden er ikke implementeret endnu.Du kan logge ud nu.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "!Jeg har sl\u00e5et Forstyr ikke til;ingen meddelelser vil genere dig.[HANDLING: ENABLE_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\" scenariet kan k\u00f8res med et enkelt tryk fra Tap to Run-kortet p\u00e5 startsk\u00e6rmen indtil videre. N\u00e5r NEXUS er p\u00e5 App Store, vil du v\u00e6re i stand til at tilf\u00f8je det til Siri direkte fra denne sk\u00e6rm.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "\" og alle dens indstillinger vil blive slettet permanent.Er du sikker?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
