    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "N\u00e5r du tilf\u00f8jer et lys, gardin, l\u00e5s eller klimaenhed, er pr\u00e6paratet listet her.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
