    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "N\u00e5r du har indtastet dine oplysninger, kan du nemt nulstille din adgangskode ved at f\u00f8lge de trin, vi sender.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Brug NEXUS desktop-appen p\u00e5 din computer;den samme assistent og kontroller fungerer ogs\u00e5 der.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Chat ogs\u00e5 fra din computer;dine samtaler forbliver synkroniserede p\u00e5 tv\u00e6rs af dine enheder.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Deltag i et hjem", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e5r en enhed t\u00e6nder eller slukker", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Tryk p\u00e5 en enhed for at \u00e5bne panelets kontrolsk\u00e6rm;den viser kun de funktioner, som enheden underst\u00f8tter.For Shelly-, WLED- og ESPHome-enheder g\u00e5r t\u00e6nd/sluk og lysstyrke direkte til enheden.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Denne kode bruges p\u00e5 sk\u00e6rmbilledet Join a Home.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
    "Bir kez dokunman\u0131z yeterli": "Et tryk er alt, hvad der skal til", // EN: One tap is all it takes
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturdu\u011funda saat ve aksiyonlar burada ger\u00e7ek verilerle g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "N\u00e5r du har oprettet en plan, vises tider og handlinger her med rigtige data.", // EN: Once you create a plan, times and actions will appear here with real data.
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturunca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Den vises her, n\u00e5r du har oprettet en plan.", // EN: It will appear here once you create a plan.
    "Bir sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Er der noget galt?Send feedback", // EN: Something wrong? Send feedback
