    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Denne 8-cifrede kode er til Apple HomeKit-parring og fungerer kun med Apple Home-appen.Hvis enheden underst\u00f8tter en lokal API s\u00e5som Shelly, WLED eller Tasmota, kan du tilf\u00f8je den fra dit lokale netv\u00e6rk.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Denne enhed", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Denne QR-kode tilh\u00f8rer et Wi-Fi-netv\u00e6rk, ikke en enhed.N\u00e5r du har tilsluttet enheden til det samme netv\u00e6rk, kan du tilf\u00f8je den fra dit lokale netv\u00e6rk.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Der blev ikke fundet nogen kendt NEXUS-enhed p\u00e5 denne adresse.S\u00f8rg for, at enheden er t\u00e6ndt og p\u00e5 det samme netv\u00e6rk.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Opret denne smarte app:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Forbereder foresl\u00e5ede funktioner til dette flow.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Gemt denne m\u00e5ned", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Der blev ikke fundet nogen underst\u00f8ttet enhed p\u00e5 dette netv\u00e6rk.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Der blev ikke fundet nogen underst\u00f8ttet enhed p\u00e5 dette netv\u00e6rk.S\u00f8rg for, at enheden er t\u00e6ndt og tilsluttet den samme Wi-Fi;ellers brug nedenst\u00e5ende katalog eller en QR / ops\u00e6tningskode.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Lokal beskyttelse for denne enhed", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Denne enhed deler ikke versionsoplysninger", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Denne enhed eller forbindelse underst\u00f8tter ikke lommelygten.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Denne enhed underst\u00f8tter ikke automatisk placering.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Denne invitationskode blev ikke fundet.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Denne sk\u00e6rm grupperer de belysningsenheder, du har tilf\u00f8jet, efter rum;n\u00e5r du gemmer en scene, indstilles lysstyrke og tone sammen.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Enheder, du f\u00f8jer til dette hjem, er angivet her.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Enheder, du f\u00f8jer til dette hjem, er anf\u00f8rt her og knyttet til dine yndlingskort.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Er du sikker p\u00e5, at du vil slette dette hjem og alle dets indstillinger permanent?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Denne kode er ikke en underst\u00f8ttet enhedskode.Hvis du kender enhedens IP-adresse, kan du tilf\u00f8je den fra dit lokale netv\u00e6rk.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Disse m\u00e6rker styres over dit lokale netv\u00e6rk", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Denne mini-app leveres af den officielle udbyder.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Dette milj\u00f8 underst\u00f8tter ikke kameraadgang.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Netv\u00e6rksscanning er ikke tilg\u00e6ngelig her.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "Ingen sikker kryptering i dette milj\u00f8", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "N\u00e5r dette scenarie k\u00f8rer, justeres de relaterede enheder automatisk.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Ingen enheder p\u00e5virkes af dette scenarie \u2013 tilf\u00f8j f\u00f8rst en passende enhed.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Du skal tilf\u00f8je en kompatibel enhed for at bruge dette scenarie.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Dette er dit eneste hjem.Hvis du sletter det, oprettes et tomt \"Mit hjem\" igen.Forts\u00e6tte?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
