    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Indtast enhedens IP-adresse, og NEXUS finder ud af, hvilken protokol den taler.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Tjek enhedens Wi-Fi-forbindelse og din router.Hvis problemet forts\u00e6tter, skal du fjerne enheden og tilf\u00f8je den igen.Trin: Enheder > v\u00e6lg enheden > Fjern.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Tjek enhedens Wi-Fi-forbindelse og din router.Hvis problemet forts\u00e6tter, skal du fjerne enheden fra NEXUS-appen og tilf\u00f8je den igen.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Hvis din enhed ikke vises, skal du bruge QR-scanning eller en ops\u00e6tningskode.Du kan \u00e5bne hj\u00e6lpesiden for st\u00f8tte og vejledning.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Din enheds placeringstjeneste (GPS) er sl\u00e5et fra.T\u00e6nd den og pr\u00f8v igen.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
