    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Forlader Hjemmet", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Forlader hjemmetjek", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Forlader hjemmescenen", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Resum\u00e9 af at forlade hjemmet", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Afslut med at forlade hjemmet", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Opret en forlader-hjemmetjek-app, der viser enheder, der er t\u00e6ndt, l\u00e5sestatus og energiindstillinger p\u00e5 \u00e9n sk\u00e6rm.Tilf\u00f8j hurtig sluk- og sikkerhedsaktiveringsknapper.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Tjek enheder, der er t\u00e6ndt, l\u00e5se og energistatus i \u00e9t flow, n\u00e5r du forlader hjemmet.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Vis enheder, der er t\u00e6ndt, l\u00e5se og energistatus p\u00e5 \u00e9n sk\u00e6rm, n\u00e5r du forlader hjemmet.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Se lys, stik, AC'er og sikkerhedsindstillinger efterladt t\u00e6ndt, f\u00f8r du tager hjemmefra, p\u00e5 \u00e9t panel.Saml hurtige sluk- og sikkerhedsaktiveringstrin i \u00e9t flow.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Lad os foretage de sidste kontroller, inden du tager af sted.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Sluk lyset automatisk efter afgang...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Sluk lyset automatisk, n\u00e5r du forlader hjemmet", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Sluk lyset automatisk, n\u00e5r du tager afsted, og t\u00e6nd dem, n\u00e5r du kommer tilbage.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Sluk automatisk klimaanl\u00e6gget, n\u00e5r ingen er hjemme, og undg\u00e5 un\u00f8dvendigt forbrug.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Afbryd automatisk str\u00f8mmen til enheder p\u00e5 standby p\u00e5 det tidspunkt, du v\u00e6lger om natten.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
