    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Par og tilf\u00f8j", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Parringskoden er ikke gyldig.Indtast den 11-cifrede kode eller QR-indholdet, der starter med MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Indtast denne kode i NEXUS desktop-appen.Hvis enheden er p\u00e5 Wi-Fi, kan du ogs\u00e5 tilf\u00f8je den fra dit lokale netv\u00e6rk ved hj\u00e6lp af dens IP-adresse.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Enheden s\u00f8ges efter p\u00e5 det samme netv\u00e6rk og parres.Dette kan tage op til et minut;enheden skal v\u00e6re t\u00e6ndt og i parringstilstand.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "The device was not found or could not be paired.S\u00f8rg for, at den er p\u00e5 det samme netv\u00e6rk, t\u00e6ndt og i parringstilstand.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "The device was not found.S\u00f8rg for, at den er p\u00e5 det samme netv\u00e6rk, t\u00e6ndt og i parringstilstand.Din computers firewall blokerer muligvis svar fra enheder p\u00e5 det lokale netv\u00e6rk.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "The device could not be paired.Kontroller parringskoden, og at enheden er i parringstilstand.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Enheden er parret, men har ingen funktion, som NEXUS kan styre.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "The device did not respond.Make sure it is on and on the same network.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
