    "T\u00fcm evi oda bazl\u0131 kontrol eden bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131k paneli olu\u015ftur. Her oda i\u00e7in ac/kapat, parlakl\u0131k ve renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 kontrolleri olsun. Hemen kullan\u0131labilecek h\u0131zl\u0131 yuzdeler ve tumunu ac/tumunu kapat aksiyonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Skab et smart lyspanel, der styrer hele hjemmet rum for rum.Inkluder t\u00e6nd/sluk, lysstyrke og farvetemperaturkontrol for hvert rum.Tilf\u00f8j hurtige procenter, der er klar til brug, og alle t\u00e6nd/sluk-handlinger.", // EN: Create a smart lighting panel that controls the whole home room by room. Include on/off, brightness and color temperature controls for each room. Add ready-to-use quick percentages and all on/all off actions.
