    "Kapans\u0131n": "Sluk", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "V\u00e6lg den enhed, der skal styres.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Se den luftkvalitet, temperatur og luftfugtighed, som dine sensorer m\u00e5ler, og styr din renser.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "G\u00f8r lys, gardiner og AC klar til dagen med et enkelt tryk.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "T\u00e6nd lys, gardiner og klima sammen, n\u00e5r du kommer hjem.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "S\u00e6t dine enheder i en sikker, energibesparende tilstand, mens du er v\u00e6k l\u00e6nge.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "D\u00e6mp lyset, luk gardinerne og t\u00e6nd for fjernsynet.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Start din robotst\u00f8vsuger, eller send den tilbage til dens dock.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "L\u00e5s d\u00f8ren, luk gardinerne og g\u00f8r huset klar til natten.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Se status og privatlivsindstillinger for dine kameraer p\u00e5 \u00e9n sk\u00e6rm.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Sl\u00e5 privatlivstilstand til eller fra for dine kameraer fra \u00e9t sted, mens du er hjemme.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Se hvilken automatisering der k\u00f8rer hvorn\u00e5r i dag.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Del noter og g\u00f8rem\u00e5l med din husstand.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Se dit hjems helbredsoversigt ud fra den luft, luftfugtighed og temperatur, som dine sensorer m\u00e5ler.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
