    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Ingen m\u00e5linger registreret endnu.Tilf\u00f8j en enhed, der m\u00e5ler str\u00f8m, og \u00e5bn denne side;l\u00e6sninger vil bygge op her.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Intervaller uden m\u00e5l t\u00e6lles ikke med, s\u00e5 v\u00e6rdierne kan v\u00e6re lavere end det faktiske forbrug.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
