    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Kunne ikke oprette forbindelse til enheden.S\u00f8rg for, at det er p\u00e5 samme netv\u00e6rk.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Kunne ikke oprette forbindelse til enheden.S\u00f8rg for, at den er p\u00e5 det samme netv\u00e6rk, og at IP-adressen og den lokale n\u00f8gle er korrekte.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "T\u00e6nder lyset i en varm tone, \u00e5bner gardinerne og indstiller AC til 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "T\u00e6nder lyset og \u00e5bner gardinerne, k\u00f8rer AC ved 22\u00b0 og sender vakuumet tilbage til opladning.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Slukker lyset, TV og AC, lukker gardinerne og l\u00e5ser d\u00f8ren.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Slukker lyset og fjernsynet, lukker gardinerne og l\u00e5ser d\u00f8ren.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Indstiller lysene til en varm tone p\u00e5 15 %, lukker gardinerne og t\u00e6nder for tv'et.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "L\u00e5ser d\u00f8ren og lukker gardinerne.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "T\u00e6nder lyset ved 70 % lysstyrke.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Starter robotst\u00f8vsugeren.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Hverdage 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Indstiller AC og termostat til komfortindstillingen og k\u00f8rer luftrenseren.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "Sender en notifikation", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Dette scenarie p\u00e5virker ikke nogen af dine nuv\u00e6rende enheder.For at f\u00e5 det til at fungere skal du tilf\u00f8je en passende enhed (f.eks. et lys, et gardin eller et vakuum).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Opret et nyt hjem, eller tilslut dig et med invitationskoden sendt til dig.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Du er ikke logget ind. Hjem opbevares kun p\u00e5 denne enhed.Log ind for at invitere medlemmer, deltage i et hjem og bruge familiechatten.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
