    "Sonraki \u00f6deme {0} tutar\u0131nda {1} tarihinde al\u0131nacak.": "N\u00e6ste betaling p\u00e5 {0} debiteres den {1}.", // EN: Next payment of {0} will be charged on {1}.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki cihazlar internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 olmadan, ev a\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS'a ba\u011flan\u0131r. Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar {0} modelden se\u00e7ilir.": "Enhederne nedenfor opretter forbindelse til NEXUS p\u00e5 dit hjemmenetv\u00e6rk uden internetforbindelse.V\u00e6lg mellem {0} modeller.", // EN: The devices below connect to NEXUS on your home network, without an internet connection. Choose from {0} models.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS n\u00e5r dine enheder direkte fra sin egen app;den har ingen indbygget HomeKit-bro.For at bruge dem med Apple Home (HomeKit) er den praktiske vej {0}: f\u00f8j dine enheder til Home Assistant, og aktiver derefter HA's HomeKit-integration.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; it has no built-in HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; {0} yerle\u015fik bir HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc Apple Ev'e ger\u00e7ek aksesuar yay\u0131nlar (a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki panelden ba\u015flat). Web/telefon s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde k\u00f6pr\u00fc yoktur.": "NEXUS n\u00e5r dine enheder direkte fra sin egen app;p\u00e5 skrivebordet udgiver {0} indbygget HomeKit bridge \u00e6gte tilbeh\u00f8r til Apple Home (start det fra panelet nedenfor).Web-/telefonversionen har ingen bro.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; on desktop, {0} built-in HomeKit bridge publishes real accessories to Apple Home (start it from the panel below). The web/phone version has no bridge.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS n\u00e5r dine enheder direkte fra sin egen app;telefon-/webversionen inkluderer ikke en HomeKit-bro.For at bruge dem med Apple Home (HomeKit) er den praktiske vej {0}: f\u00f8j dine enheder til Home Assistant, og aktiver derefter HA's HomeKit-integration.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; the phone/web version does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS'ta {0} \u00fczerinden Home Assistant'\u0131 ba\u011fla.": "Tilslut Home Assistant gennem {0} i NEXUS.", // EN: Connect Home Assistant through {0} in NEXUS.
