    "\u00d6deme sayfas\u0131nda {0} kullan; abonelik bu e-postayla e\u015fle\u015fir. Deneme s\u00fcresi bitmeden iptal edersen \u00fccret al\u0131nmaz. Aboneli\u011fini Faturaland\u0131rma sayfas\u0131ndan istedi\u011fin an y\u00f6netebilirsin.": "Brug {0} p\u00e5 betalingssiden;dit abonnement er matchet med denne e-mail.Annuller f\u00f8r pr\u00f8veperioden slutter, og du bliver aldrig debiteret.Administrer dit abonnement til enhver tid fra siden Fakturering.", // EN: Use {0} on the payment page; your subscription is matched to this email. Cancel before the trial ends and you're never charged. Manage your subscription any time from the Billing page.
